Display the player's current room

Display the available directions

Ask the player:
    "Enter a command: north, south, east, or west"

Get the player's input

IF the player enters "north"

    IF north is a valid direction from the current room
        Move the player to the room north of the current room
        Display the new room
    ELSE
        Display "You cannot move north from this room."
    END IF

ELSE IF the player enters "south"

    IF south is a valid direction from the current room
        Move the player to the room south of the current room
        Display the new room
    ELSE
        Display "You cannot move south from this room."
    END IF

ELSE IF the player enters "east"

    IF east is a valid direction from the current room
        Move the player to the room east of the current room
        Display the new room
    ELSE
        Display "You cannot move east from this room."
    END IF

ELSE IF the player enters "west"

    IF west is a valid direction from the current room
        Move the player to the room west of the current room
        Display the new room
    ELSE
        Display "You cannot move west from this room."
    END IF

ELSE
    Display "Invalid direction. Please enter north, south, east, or west."
END IF
